repository-code: "https://github.com/fire-digital-twin-lab/IFCtoFDS"
url: "https://github.com/fire-digital-twin-lab/IFCtoFDS"
abstract: >
  A verified BIM-to-FDS mapping and electric vehicle fire scenario simulation
  framework. Converts IFC building models into NIST Fire Dynamics Simulator input
  geometry with 14-gate independent audit, 64-bit float precision, automated
  multi-mesh domain partitioning, and standardized t^2 EV battery fire simulation.
